      "facts": [
        "Releases build on GitHub Actions. A binary built anywhere else keeps its token out of the macOS Keychain (auth-token-store.ts).",
        "A locally built binary: macOS ties the Keychain item to each binary's ad-hoc signature, so every rebuild would ask for the login password.",
        "One item per credentials file, so FREEBUFF_CONFIG_DIR profiles and dev stacks never share a token."
